    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swipe Like a Champion:</strong> Every day, new profiles appear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Art of Small Talk:</strong> Keep your matches interested by choosing the right conversation topics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Match: </strong>Try the Gold Match feature to type <i>whatever you want</i>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Love:</strong> Use a Instant Love to start a quick mini-game.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Album:</strong> Once a person falls in love with you, their card is added to your collection.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swipe Like a Champion:</strong> Every day, new profiles appear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Art of Small Talk:</strong> Keep your matches interested by choosing the right conversation topics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Match: </strong>Try the Gold Match feature to type <i>whatever you want</i>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Love:</strong> Use a Instant Love to start a quick mini-game.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Album:</strong> Once a person falls in love with you, their card is added to your collection.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dating App Simulator is a quirky little game about matching with people, talking to them, and trying to make them fall for you. You can date anyone you like; men, women, or both.",
